  'rental-disclaimer': { en:'⚠ This document is generated as a starting point. Rental laws vary by country and region. We strongly recommend having this agreement reviewed by a local legal professional before signing.', nl:'⚠ Dit document is een startpunt. Huurrecht verschilt per land en regio. Laat deze overeenkomst controleren door een lokale juridisch professional voordat je tekent.', es:'⚠ Este documento es un punto de partida. Las leyes de alquiler varían según el país y la región. Recomendamos encarecidamente que un profesional legal local revise este contrato antes de firmarlo.', fr:'⚠ Ce document est un point de départ. Le droit locatif varie selon les pays et les régions. Nous vous recommandons vivement de faire examiner ce contrat par un professionnel juridique local avant de le signer.', de:'⚠ Dieses Dokument ist ein Ausgangspunkt. Das Mietrecht variiert je nach Land und Region. Wir empfehlen dringend, diesen Vertrag vor der Unterzeichnung von einem lokalen Rechtsexperten prüfen zu lassen.', pt:'⚠ This document is generated as a starting point. Rental laws vary by country and region. We strongly recommend having this agreement reviewed by a local legal professional before signing.', it:'⚠ This document is generated as a starting point. Rental laws vary by country and region. We strongly recommend having this agreement reviewed by a local legal professional before signing.', ru:'⚠ This document is generated as a starting point. Rental laws vary by country and region. We strongly recommend having this agreement reviewed by a local legal professional before signing.' },
